  "title": "White House Takes Down 'Build the Wall' Game After Tetris Company Complaints",
  "summary": "The White House has removed its long-running arcade game 'Build the Wall' after the Tetris Company posted that it takes 'copyright infringement' seriously. The game, which involved block stacking mechanics, was previously launched as a racist ripoff.",
